        "opening_excerpt": [
          {
            "speaker": "Jainil Trivedi",
            "timestamp": "00:00:00",
            "text": "The thought process taking place."
          },
          {
            "speaker": "Jainil Trivedi",
            "timestamp": "00:00:01",
            "text": "So what we have over here is what the purpose and the audience is that when the owners who are getting inquiries and tour bookings, but they"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "Jainil Trivedi",
            "timestamp": "00:00:12",
            "text": "What is the central point of this particular content angle?"
          }
        ],
        "summary_present": true,
        "summary_keys": [
          "markdown_formatted",
          "template_name"
        ],
        "summary_characters": 7358,
        "summary_excerpt": "## Meeting Purpose\n\n[Review AI-generated content concepts and provide feedback for refinement.](https://fathom.video/share/v9E6zC1iAtRDz5Jd5Maz-UpuKHzqgVbJ?tab=summary&timestamp=1.0)\n\n## Key Takeaways\n\n  - [**Content Angle Approved:** The \"inquiries but no follow-through\" angle was approved for its tangible focus on lead progression, a significant improvement over the previous draft.](https://fathom.video/share/v9E6zC1iAtRDz5Jd5Maz-UpuKHzqgVbJ?tab=summary&timestamp=90.0)\n  - [**Strategic Reframing Required:** Content must shift from a DIY \"how-to\" guide to a partner-led narrative. The goal is to demonstrate WIA's value by solving a client's specific problem, not to teach the audience how to solve it themselves.](https://fathom.video/share/v9E6zC1iAtRDz5Jd5Maz-UpuKHzqgVbJ?tab=summary&timestamp=600.0)\n  - [**Tone & Voice Refinement:** The AI-generated copy needs significant work to match Whitney's casual, conversational style. Hooks must be punchier, and the overall tone less polished.](https://fathom.video/share/v9E6zC1iAtRDz5Jd5Maz-UpuKHzqgVbJ?tab=summary&timestamp=1177.0)\n  - [**Increased Cadence & New Data Source:** The target is 3 strong content angles per week. To supplement call transcripts, WIA approved a $50 one-time purchase of a SERP API to pull trending Google data, ensuring a consistent content pipeline.](https://fathom.video/share/v9E6zC1iAtRDz5Jd5Maz-UpuKHzqgVbJ?tab=summary&timestamp=1573.0)\n\n## Topics\n\n### Content Angle & Strategy\n\n  - [Jainil presented the new content angle: \"Owners getting inquiries and tour bookings but uncertain about follow-through.\"](htt",
