        "summary_excerpt": "## Meeting Purpose\n\n[Review client feature requests and plan implementation.](https://fathom.video/share/yD6sc8--vqUV1xMbN-R-vuo8hq5LRhit?tab=summary&timestamp=0.0)\n\n## Key Takeaways\n\n  - [**New Features:** Implement a threaded comment section for proposals/SOPs and a project progress chart to meet client requests.](https://fathom.video/share/yD6sc8--vqUV1xMbN-R-vuo8hq5LRhit?tab=summary&timestamp=0.0)\n  - [**Notifications:** Comments will trigger email/in-app notifications for relevant team members to ensure timely engagement.](https://fathom.video/share/yD6sc8--vqUV1xMbN-R-vuo8hq5LRhit?tab=summary&timestamp=19.0)\n  - [**Dependencies:** The progress chart requires a client-provided credential/API list, which will be requested via LastPass.](https://fathom.video/share/yD6sc8--vqUV1xMbN-R-vuo8hq5LRhit?tab=summary&timestamp=47.0)\n\n## Topics\n\n### Client Feature Requests\n\n  - [**Goal:** Add depth to proposals and SOPs.](https://fathom.video/share/yD6sc8--vqUV1xMbN-R-vuo8hq5LRhit?tab=summary&timestamp=0.0)\n  - [**Specific Requests:**](https://fathom.video/share/yD6sc8--vqUV1xMbN-R-vuo8hq5LRhit?tab=summary&timestamp=0.0)\n    1.  **Threaded Comment Section:**\n          - [**Function:** Allow clients to comment and reply on specific sections.](https://fathom.video/share/yD6sc8--vqUV1xMbN-R-vuo8hq5LRhit?tab=summary&timestamp=19.0)\n          - [**Notification:** Triggers email/in-app alerts for relevant team members.](https://fathom.video/share/yD6sc8--vqUV1xMbN-R-vuo8hq5LRhit?tab=summary&timestamp=19.0)\n    2.  **Project Progress Chart:**\n          - [**Function:** Visually track pro",
